sting and requests</h2><p>Pages, styles, scripts, and photographs load from the same site. No external submission service is connected. If this sample is served by a hosting provider or displayed inside a gallery, that service may receive ordinary request information such as an IP address, requested file, and browser details. Its own policies govern that processing; this sample does not control hosting logs or the surrounding gallery.</p></section><section id="photography"><h2>05 / Photography and project descriptions</h2><p>The architectural photographs are illustrative stock by Pierre Châtel-Innocenti and Annie Spratt, supplied locally under the Unsplash License. They are not photographs of Common Ground projects and do not imply a relationship between the photographers, the buildings shown, and this fictional practice.</p></section><section id="questions"><h2>06 / Questions about the sample</h2><p>The example contact address is not monitored. For questions about where this sample is hosted or how the surrounding gallery handles data, contact the operator of that gallery through their own website.</p><p>You can return to the <a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/' ) ); ?>">demo inquiry</a> or explore the <a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/work/' ) ); ?>">fictional project studies</a>.</p></section></div></div>
